<notes><![CDATA[[DE_ENTI_COMMENT[
Ding das uns interessiert im systemübergreifenden, konsolidierten, konzeptionellen Modell eines Unternehmens
]DE_ENTI_COMMENT]
[EN_ENTI_COMMENT[
Designates something that exists, a being, a tangible or abstract object with properties and relationships.
Thing of interest in the considered environment / mini-world.
It is IT-system- and technology-independent and consolidated description of the structure and meaning of the thing of interest.
An entity can in turn consist of individual parts (attributes, subentities, relationships, etc.) ; corresponding to the term holon or whole/part.
]EN_ENTI_COMMENT]
]]></notes>
